struction: if a library calls `Stdout.line` and the platform doesn't expose `Stdout`, it does not compile — there is no ambient I/O to fall back to (Roc FAQ: https://www.roc-lang.org/faq).\n- The policy table states, per tier: which classes are allowed, what the author must declare, and what the import checker verifies against the platform catalog (`pkgs/id/crates/id-core/src/world_caps.rs`).\n- One compile-fail fixture per class (a package in the class, a platform that must reject it), wired so the fixtures cannot silently rot — distinct from the single demo pair in the demo task under #5955, which proves the mechanism end-to-end.\n\n## Done looks like\n\nA policy table (class × tier → allowed/declared/checked) plus the per-class compile-fail fixtures specified or landed.\n","closed_by":{"login":"developing-today[bot]","id":347365078,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFLRe1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26439447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/developing-today","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues